---
---

<section class="tight" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-reveal>
      <div class="label">About</div>
      <h2 class="display">
        I build what I <em>need</em><br>from Tanta, Egypt<span class="dot">.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lead">
        CS student at <span class="ejust"><span class="ejust__seal" aria-hidden="true">技</span><span class="ejust__roman">E-JUST</span><span class="ejust__tategaki" aria-hidden="true">エジプト日本科学技術大学</span></span> who builds tools I need. Sotto because dictation apps kept my voice in the cloud. Sukoon because reading my own glucose data shouldn't be a chore. Kai's Flow because no planner fit my day. shaheentire.com because the family business needed a working site — 300+ commits and 100+ PRs later, it does. I don't wait to be assigned tickets. I build the thing, then ship it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-stat" data-reveal>
        <div class="stat-ring solid coral large">300+</div>
        <div><b>Production Commits</b><span>On shaheentire.com</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stat" data-reveal>
        <div class="stat-ring solid coral large">2</div>
        <div><b>Spoken Languages</b><span>AR · EN</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stat" data-reveal>
        <div class="stat-ring solid large">100+</div>
        <div><b>PRs Merged</b><span>Across projects</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .about-stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: var(--bone);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
  }
  .about-stat b { display: block; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .about-stat span { font-family: var(--body); font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-mute); }
  .stat-ring.large { width: 44px; height: 44px; font-size: 13px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* Pull lead slightly closer to accommodate taller H2 */
  #about .lead { max-width: 62ch; }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
